    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of Queens Climax begins on Princess Crystelle's 18th birthday in the Kingdom of Brighton. It was a celebration. However, little did the people know their time of happiness would be violently cut short. A discrete band of assassins infiltrated the unsuspecting castle and wiped out the entire royal family\u2014except for one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kidnapped and enslaved, Princess Crystelle, must make her way through Valenhein Castle and its inhabitants to find her way out of the twisted grip of Queen Renea!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imps, Orcs, and Minotaurs, oh my! From dungeons to gardens, the captured Crystelle must escape her cell and sexually satisfy the citizens of Valenhein until she finds a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CHARACTERS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807610/extras/4e4ba3d8d662363365db528debe63517.poster.avif?t=1747935086\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807610/extras/4e4ba3d8d662363365db528debe63517.webm?t=1747935086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807610/extras/4e4ba3d8d662363365db528debe63517.mp4?t=1747935086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Princess Crystelle: Pure, submissive, and empathetic, the newly eighteen-year-old loved her people in every sense of the word. She would not wish ill on anyone, nor would she have her parents killed and her kingdom conquered.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807610/extras/c0bba48648fea5ba3446b6ae001f6579.poster.avif?t=1747935086\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807610/extras/c0bba48648fea5ba3446b6ae001f6579.webm?t=1747935086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807610/extras/c0bba48648fea5ba3446b6ae001f6579.mp4?t=1747935086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queen Renea: Lustful, chaotic, and malicious. The newly-turned Queen rules with her latest whim. Sleeping with whom she wishes and cursing who she desires. Can a woman who is always right be wronged? Well, if so... A wise man once said, &quot;Hell hath no fury like a woman scorned.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2807610/extras/438d4cfa0516deea5dc7c7b4019f82d2.avif?t=1747935086\" data-has-big width=800 height=96 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated characters and NSFW scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Locations in Valenheim Castle to explore!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue choices turn enemies into your friends (or not) and change the story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorable soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story and characters that will have your heart melting or raging with satisfaction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
